{
    "version": "0.12.5",
    "description": "可扩展的 Vim 增强版编辑器，配置与数据持久化到 Scoop persist（不写 C 盘） | Vim-fork focused on extensibility and usability",
    "homepage": "https://neovim.io/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Apache-2.0,Vim",
        "url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/LICENSE"
    },
    "suggest": {
        "vcredist": "extras/vcredist2022",
        "ripgrep": "main/ripgrep"
    },
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/download/v0.12.5/nvim-win64.zip",
            "hash": "de8625ba8cf65ebf40eb80a388ba1ec8e9c15b30218821e2c639119b05920de1",
            "extract_dir": "nvim-win64"
        },
        "arm64": {
            "url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/download/v0.12.5/nvim-win-arm64.zip",
            "hash": "f5a2f7ee4603e0185ed5c3e6dc9db762499426baf1c6613a487da5b5e126ae55",
            "extract_dir": "nvim-win-arm64"
        }
    },
    "bin": [
        "bin\\nvim.exe",
        "bin\\xxd.exe"
    ],
    "persist": [
        "config",
        "data",
        "state",
        "cache"
    ],
    "env_set": {
        "NVIM_APPNAME": "config",
        "XDG_CONFIG_HOME": "$persist_dir",
        "XDG_DATA_HOME": "$persist_dir\\data",
        "XDG_STATE_HOME": "$persist_dir\\state",
        "XDG_CACHE_HOME": "$persist_dir\\cache"
    },
    "notes": [
        "配置真源：D:\\PortableApps\\Scoop\\persist\\neovim\\config\\init.lua，升级/重装不丢失；",
        "env_set 写入的是用户级持久环境变量，安装后需重开终端（或注销重登）才生效；",
        "XDG_* 为跨应用共享变量，极少数其他工具（如 git 的备用配置路径）也可能读取，若发现异常可 scoop uninstall neovim 后手动清除这些用户环境变量；",
        "依赖 ripgrep（telescope 内容搜索）与 node（pyright 等 LSP 运行时）。"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/releases/latest",
        "jsonpath": "$.body",
        "regex": "NVIM v(?<majorVersion>[\\w.-]+)\\.(?<minorVersion>[\\w.-]+)\\.(?<patchVersion>[\\w.-]+)",
        "replace": "${majorVersion}.${minorVersion}.${patchVersion}"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/download/v$version/nvim-win64.zip"
            },
            "arm64": {
                "url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/download/v$version/nvim-win-arm64.zip"
            }
        }
    }
}
